        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Barbara Freer, Michael McDonald\n- Events: 1979 $400 Ladies - Limit 7 Card Stud, 2004 tournament, 2011 competition\n- Roles: Commissioner, gold bracelet holder winner\n\nFacts:\n- Barbara Freer was the champion of the 1979 $400 Ladies - Limit 7 Card Stud event at this tournament.\n- The winner of the 2004 tournament was a gold bracelet holder.\n- That 2004 tournament winner held the Commissioner role in the 2011 competition.\n- In the 2011 competition, poker player Michael McDonald was the youngest child to win an event.",
